      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>custom</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>custom provides gathering configuration. It is required when mode is Custom, and forbidden otherwise. Custom configuration allows user to disable only a subset of gatherers. Gatherers that are not explicitly disabled in custom configuration will run.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>mode</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>mode is a required field that specifies the mode for gatherers. Allowed values are All and Custom. When set to All, all gatherers will run and gather data. When set to Custom, the custom configuration from the custom field will be applied.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      </TableBody>
      </Table>
      <h3 id="_specgathererscustom" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.gatherers.custom<a href="#_specgathererscustom" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>custom provides gathering configuration. It is required when mode is Custom, and forbidden otherwise. Custom configuration allows user to disable only a subset of gatherers. Gatherers that are not explicitly disabled in custom configuration will run.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Required</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><ul><li><code>configs</code></li></ul></dd>
