      <h3 id="_specgathererscustomconfigs" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.gatherers.custom.configs<a href="#_specgathererscustomconfigs" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>configs is a required list of gatherers configurations that can be used to enable or disable specific gatherers. It may not exceed 100 items and each gatherer can be present only once. It is possible to disable an entire set of gatherers while allowing a specific function within that set. The particular gatherers IDs can be found at https://github.com/openshift/insights-operator/blob/master/docs/gathered-data.md. Run the following command to get the names of last active gatherers: "oc get insightsoperators.operator.openshift.io cluster -o json | jq '.status.gatherStatus.gatherers[].name'"</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
