      <TableCell><code>integer</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>observedGeneration represents the .metadata.generation that the condition was set based upon. For instance, if .metadata.generation is currently 12, but the .status.conditions[x].observedGeneration is 9, the condition is out of date with respect to the current state of the instance.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
