      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>reason contains a programmatic identifier indicating the reason for the condition’s last transition. Producers of specific condition types may define expected values and meanings for this field, and whether the values are considered a guaranteed API. The value should be a CamelCase string. This field may not be empty.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>status</code></TableCell>
